# The on-prem images build from a context SRC holding this repository as workcell/ and panoptes-serving as serving/
# (docker/*.Dockerfile). scripts/onprem/stage_context.sh copies this file to SRC/.dockerignore; if you assemble SRC yourself,
# copy it there (Docker reads .dockerignore at the context root). Only the code the Dockerfiles COPY is sent to the daemon:
# never outputs/ (24 GB in panoptes-serving), .venv/, node_modules/, runs, weights or .git.
*
!workcell/docker
!workcell/scripts
!workcell/modal_apps
!workcell/configs
!serving/scripts
!serving/modal_apps
!serving/ehs_spatial
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
**/.venv
**/node_modules
**/outputs
**/.git
**/.DS_Store
